window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-hoshinomiya-chie"]=[{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v1-p139-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action spoken","w":"chabashira-sae ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hallway flirtation   history with chabashira class 1 b homeroom teacher  hallway outside faculty staff room  inspecting her makeup appearance in a mirror when ayanokoji calls out seeking chabashira  wavy  shoulder length hair  mature looks  bubbly student like demeanor   hmm  sae chan  oh  she was just here a moment ago  follows ayanokoji into the hallway when he steps outside to wait  barrages him with inquisitive  overly familiar questions   i m hoshinomiya chie  in charge of class b  sae and i have been best friends since high school  that s why we call each other sae chan and chie chan   hey  why did sae chan call you  huh  huh  why  i don t understand  you were called to the office without a reason  hmm  what s your name   ayanokouji kun  huh  oh  wow  that s a cool name  you re pretty popular  aren t you  hey  do you already have a girlfriend  clings onto ayanokoji  grabbing his arms with slender hands and caressing his cheek in playful flirtation   hmm  how unexpected  if we were in the same class  i d never leave you alone  perhaps because you re so innocent  or do you like playing hard to get  smacked over the head with a clipboard when chabashira appears  whines and playfully teases chabashira about her motives   ouch  what was that for   i was only keeping him company while he waited for you  sae chan   come on  don t be so cold  it won t be the end of the world if i listen  right  besides sae chan  you re definitely not the type to give one on one guidance  pulling a new student like ayanokouji kun into the guidance room out of nowhere  are you after something  i wonder   so  sae chan  are you looking to be dominated by a younger man  hee  you re certainly right  it wouldn t be possible for you  sae chan  whacked on the butt by chabashira s clipboard  scurries off with ichinose honami  high school classmates   lifelong friends with chabashira sae  attracted to graduates of anhs s competitive system  shamelessly flirtatious  bubbly  emotionally perceptive  uses playful intimacy to prod into other classes  affairs  high school best friends  intimate rivalrous banter  sae chan and chie chan  first encounter  singles him out for physical teasing and probing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v1-p139-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hallway flirtation &amp; history with Chabashira<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.139–141<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Hallway outside faculty staff room.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hmm? Sae-chan? Oh, she was just here a moment ago.”<span class=\"pg\">p.139<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’m Hoshinomiya Chie, in charge of Class B. Sae and I have been best friends since high school. That’s why we call each other Sae-chan and Chie-chan.”<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hey, why did Sae-chan call you? Huh? Huh? Why?… I don’t understand. You were called to the office without a reason? Hmm? What’s your name?”<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>16 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Post<\/span> Class 1-B homeroom teacher.<span class=\"pg\">p.140–141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Inspecting her makeup/appearance in a mirror when Ayanokōji calls out seeking Chabashira. Wavy, shoulder-length hair, mature looks, bubbly student-like demeanor.<span class=\"pg\">p.139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Follows Ayanokōji into the hallway when he steps outside to wait; barrages him with inquisitive, overly familiar questions.<span class=\"pg\">p.139–140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ayanokouji-kun, huh? Oh, wow, that’s a cool name. You’re pretty popular, aren’t you?… Hey, do you already have a girlfriend?”<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Clings onto Ayanokōji, grabbing his arms with slender hands and caressing his cheek in playful flirtation.<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Hmm? How unexpected. If we were in the same class, I’d never leave you alone. Perhaps because you’re so innocent? Or do you like playing hard to get?”<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Smacked over the head with a clipboard when Chabashira appears; whines and playfully teases Chabashira about her motives.<span class=\"pg\">p.140–141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ouch! What was that for?”<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I was only keeping him company while he waited for you, Sae-chan.”<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Come on, don’t be so cold! It won’t be the end of the world if I listen, right? Besides Sae-chan, you’re definitely not the type to give one-on-one guidance. Pulling a new student like Ayanokouji-kun into the guidance room out of nowhere… Are you after something, I wonder?”<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So, Sae-chan, are you looking to be dominated by a younger man?… Hee, you’re certainly right. It wouldn’t be possible for you, Sae-chan.”<span class=\"pg\">p.141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Whacked on the butt by Chabashira&#x27;s clipboard; scurries off with Ichinose Honami.<span class=\"pg\">p.141–142<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> High school classmates &amp; lifelong friends with Chabashira Sae (attracted to/graduates of ANHS&#x27;s competitive system).<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Shamelessly flirtatious, bubbly, emotionally perceptive; uses playful intimacy to prod into other classes&#x27; affairs.<span class=\"pg\">p.139–141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> High school best friends; intimate rivalrous banter (&quot;Sae-chan and Chie-chan&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.140–141<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> First encounter: singles him out for physical teasing and probing.<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v1-p226-1\">→ After: The faculty-room smile<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v1-p226-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie the faculty room smile seated in the faculty room during the test change confrontation  meets ayanokoji s eyes and gives a small smile and a wave   the only teacher besides chabashira to react at all to the incident","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v1-p226-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The faculty-room smile<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.226<\/span><\/h3><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q action\">Seated in the faculty room during the test-change confrontation; meets Ayanokōji&#x27;s eyes and gives a small smile and a wave — the only teacher besides Chabashira to react at all to the incident.<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><\/ul><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v1-p139-1\">← Before: Hallway flirtation &amp; history with Chabashira<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v2-p191-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"spoken","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 6 open  the teacher at the door the faculty room minutes before the hearing  she greets the four class d students as they arrive   yahoo  hello  class d students   it seems like something rather incredible has happened  hmm  her interest is appetite  not concern   her eyes sparkled  as if she enjoyed sticking her nose into other people s business  the narrator adds  in parentheses   well  she did   oh no  i ve been found out already  huh   so i guess i can t join in  huh   aw  that s too bad  well  that s all right  the results should be out within the hour  i guess  she knows the hearing schedule before it starts and expects a result inside the hour  chabashira pushes her back into the faculty room before she can say more  her exclusion states the rule from the outside   outsiders cannot participate  in a disciplinary settlement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v2-p191-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 open: the teacher at the door<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.191–192<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The faculty room minutes before the hearing; she greets the four Class D students as they arrive.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Yahoo! Hello, Class D students!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.191<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It seems like something rather incredible has happened, hmm?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.191<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Oh no. I’ve been found out already, huh?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Her interest is appetite, not concern: &quot;Her eyes sparkled, as if she enjoyed sticking her nose into other people’s business.&quot; The narrator adds, in parentheses, &quot;(Well, she did).&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.191<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;So I guess I can’t join in, huh?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Aw, that’s too bad. Well, that’s all right. The results should be out within the hour, I guess.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She knows the hearing schedule before it starts and expects a result inside the hour; Chabashira pushes her back into the faculty room before she can say more.<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Her exclusion states the rule from the outside: &quot;outsiders cannot participate&quot; in a disciplinary settlement.<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v3-p36-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 2 sec  2 1  the corridor ambush beach side  during class d s rules huddle  she tackles chabashira from behind   what  i can t be friendly  i honestly wanted to see what you d do     whenever i touch your hair  sae chan  it s always so smooth  gets the eavesdropping rebuke and the  fate  double meaning ignored  leaves with a sad look when threatened with a behavioural report  spots him and opens the summer love advice    summer is the season of love  if you want to confess your feelings to a girl you like  perhaps it d be more effective while standing before the beautiful ocean    to his visible embarrassment   you need to be more carefree","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v3-p36-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.1: the corridor ambush<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.36–38<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Beach-side, during Class D&#x27;s rules huddle; she tackles Chabashira from behind.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“What, I can’t be friendly? I honestly wanted to see what you’d do.” / “Whenever I touch your hair, Sae-chan, it’s always so smooth!”<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“You need to be more carefree!”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Gets the eavesdropping rebuke and the &quot;fate&quot; double-meaning ignored; leaves with a sad look when threatened with a behavioural report.<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Spots him and opens the summer-love advice — &quot;Summer is the season of love. If you want to confess your feelings to a girl you like, perhaps it’d be more effective while standing before the beautiful ocean?&quot; — to his visible embarrassment.<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p121-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"action spoken","w":"ichinose-honami chabashira-sae mashima-tomonari sakagami ryuuen-kakeru ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 3 sec  3 6  the class b homeroom at the sofa with chabashira and mashima at the first level vending machines  she drinks whiskey neat  owns the ichinose to rabbit move  and is ordered to stop spying   ah ha ha  we broke up two weeks ago  i m the type of girl who breaks it off once the relationship starts getting serious  it s just like  see ya later  hoshinomiya sensei said  also addresses mashima as  mashima kun  and is called  chie  back  most of the date talk lines are untagged   recorded on the volume attribution list  pours whiskey into an empty glass and downs it in one gulp    must ve been a drinker   huh  what are you talking about  what d i do   the answer to  what are you planning  chie    speaker of the question untagged   i m not screwing around or anything  it s certainly true that as far as grades and attitude are concerned  ichinose san is number one  however  someone s true place in society cannot be measured by numbers alone  i determined that she needed a challenge  and besides  rabbits are just so cute  aren t they  the way they hop around  doesn t that suit ichinose san  hoshinomiya sensei asked   oh  are you still talking about what happened ten years ago  i thought that was all water under the bridge   the ten year grudge  speaker untagged in the exchange   recorded under her as the chie being addressed   note  keeps the gap   i genuinely thought that ichinose needed to learn a lesson  so i removed her from the dragon group  you know  by the way  sae chan  i couldn t help but notice you ve been focusing on ayanokouji kun  anyway  it s just a coincidence  coincidence  coincidence  when the island test ended and ayanokouji kun became a kind of leader  you weren t surprised at all  were you   agh  it s like you don t trust me at all  well  i m not the only one to blame  sakagami sensei is part of the problem  too  if we evaluated the class c students properly  another student should ve been placed into dragon  but they threw ryuuen in there  admits she is watching ayanokoji   the reconnaissance ayanokoji files as  apparently i was under heavy scrutiny  the class b student she deliberately kept out of dragon and put in rabbit   sae chan    the focus of her  coincidence  needle  ordered to stop spying on colleagues  classes  named as part of the class c evaluation problem  the class c student  they threw  into dragon  the student she has been watching since the island endgame","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p121-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3.6: the Class B homeroom at the sofa<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.121–123<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">With Chabashira and Mashima at the first-level vending machines, she drinks whiskey neat, owns the Ichinose-to-Rabbit move, and is ordered to stop spying.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"sakagami.html\">Sakagami<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ah ha ha! We broke up two weeks ago. I’m the type of girl who breaks it off once the relationship starts getting serious. It’s just like, see ya later!” Hoshinomiya-sensei said.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Huh? What are you talking about? What’d I do?” (the answer to “What are you planning, Chie?” — speaker of the question untagged)<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’m not screwing around or anything. It’s certainly true that as far as grades and attitude are concerned, Ichinose-san is number one. However, someone’s true place in society cannot be measured by numbers alone. I determined…”<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>13 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Also addresses Mashima as “Mashima-kun” and is called “Chie” back; most of the date-talk lines are untagged — recorded on the volume attribution list.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Pours whiskey into an empty glass and downs it in one gulp — “Must’ve been a drinker.”<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m not screwing around or anything. It’s certainly true that as far as grades and attitude are concerned, Ichinose-san is number one. However, someone’s true place in society cannot be measured by numbers alone. I determined that she needed a challenge. And besides, rabbits are just so cute, aren’t they? The way they hop around. Doesn’t that suit Ichinose-san?” Hoshinomiya-sensei asked.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh, are you still talking about what happened ten years ago? I thought that was all water under the bridge.” (the ten-year grudge, speaker untagged in the exchange — recorded under her as the Chie being addressed; [note] keeps the gap)<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I genuinely thought that Ichinose needed to learn a lesson, so I removed her from the Dragon group. You know? By the way, Sae-chan, I couldn’t help but notice you’ve been focusing on Ayanokouji-kun. Anyway, it’s just a coincidence. Coincidence, coincidence. When the island test ended and Ayanokouji-kun became a kind of leader, you weren’t surprised at all, were you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Agh, it’s like you don’t trust me at all. Well, I’m not the only one to blame. Sakagami-sensei is part of the problem, too. If we evaluated the Class C students properly, another student should’ve been placed into Dragon. But they threw Ryuuen in there.”<span class=\"pg\">p.122–123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Admits she is watching Ayanokōji — the reconnaissance Ayanokōji files as “Apparently I was under heavy scrutiny.”<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> The Class B student she deliberately kept out of Dragon and put in Rabbit.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> “Sae-chan” — the focus of her “coincidence” needle.<span class=\"pg\">p.121–122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Ordered to stop spying on colleagues’ classes.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakagami<\/b> Named as part of the Class C evaluation problem.<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The Class C student “they threw” into Dragon.<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The student she has been watching since the island endgame.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p125-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4.0: the spy order in the brief<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p125-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 4 sec  4 0  the spy order in the brief named only as the teacher who secretly sent ichinose and the class b trio to watch ayanokoji   his private inventory of problems for the day  the class b three in the rabbit group are filed as her agents on him  not as random group mates  no scene presence this range  the row records the brief s attribution of the spy order","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p125-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4.0: the spy order in the brief<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.125<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named only as the teacher who secretly sent Ichinose and the Class B trio to watch Ayanokōji — his private inventory of problems for the day.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> The Class B three in the Rabbit group are filed as her agents on him, not as random group-mates.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No scene presence this range; the row records the brief’s attribution of the spy order.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p121-1\">← Before: Ch.3 sec. 3.6: the Class B homeroom at the sofa<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p167-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4.3: the drunk interruption<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p167-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka chabashira-sae ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 4 sec  4 3  the drunk interruption follows chabashira to the night pool  hugs ayanokoji smelling of alcohol  baits the private meeting as suspicious  and leaves with a  no sexy times  shot   yoohoo  sae chan  how you feeling   hmm  oh no  of course i m not  i m not drunk  i was just acting all sleepy  you know  iron liver   handled herself today and still fine   acting all sleepy  denied drunk to chabashira s face   jeez  you can really hold your liquor   chabashira s line  tagged in exchange   good evening  ayanokouji kun  how are you doing   that answer was so not cute that i m impressed  so  ayanokouji kun  do you love the tsuntsun older sister types  like sae chan  asked hoshinomiya sensei  hand on his shoulders  a tight hug  alcohol smell   overly familiar by design  the night pool chase  baits her on sneaking around  gets the  ayanokouji requested this location  answer  mutters no rules broken  exits under  hurry up and leave   so what were you two talking about in the middle of the night  isn t that in itself a really big problem  asked hoshinomiya sensei   if that s true  wouldn t it be better for you to do it with more people around  if you look like you re sneaking around  i can t help but think it s suspicious   hmm  well  i suppose you re not violating any rules  muttered hoshinomiya sensei   okay  okay  but remember  no sexy times  teased hoshinomiya sensei  bad at hiding emotions   his read that ichinose may soon wonder why she is in rabbit and discover the spy order  followed chabashira deliberately   was it just a coincidence  unlikely","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p167-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4.3: the drunk interruption<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.167–168<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Follows Chabashira to the night pool, hugs Ayanokōji smelling of alcohol, baits the private meeting as suspicious, and leaves with a “no sexy times” shot.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Yoohoo, Sae-chan! How you feeling?”<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hmm? Oh no, of course I’m not, I’m not drunk. I was just acting all sleepy, you know?”<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Jeez. You can really hold your liquor.” (Chabashira’s line, tagged in exchange)<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Iron liver — handled herself today and still fine; “acting all sleepy” denied drunk to Chabashira’s face.<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Good evening, Ayanokouji-kun. How are you doing?”<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That answer was so not-cute that I’m impressed! So, Ayanokouji-kun, do you love the tsuntsun older sister types, like Sae-chan?” asked Hoshinomiya-sensei.<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Hand on his shoulders, a tight hug, alcohol smell — overly familiar by design.<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> The night-pool chase: baits her on sneaking around, gets the “Ayanokouji requested this location” answer, mutters no rules broken, exits under “hurry up and leave.”<span class=\"pg\">p.167-168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So what were you two talking about in the middle of the night? Isn’t that in itself a really big problem?” asked Hoshinomiya-sensei.<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If that’s true, wouldn’t it be better for you to do it with more people around? If you look like you’re sneaking around, I can’t help but think it’s suspicious.”<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Hmm. Well, I suppose you’re not violating any rules,” muttered Hoshinomiya-sensei.<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Okay, okay. But remember, no sexy times,” teased Hoshinomiya-sensei.<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Bad at hiding emotions — his read that Ichinose may soon wonder why she is in Rabbit and discover the spy order.<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Followed Chabashira deliberately; “Was it just a coincidence? Unlikely.”<span class=\"pg\">p.167<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p125-1\">← Before: Ch.4 sec. 4.0: the spy order in the brief<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p169-1\">→ After: Ch.4: walking away<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p169-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 4  walking away the night pool encounter ends  he leaves in the direction opposite hers  ayanokoji decides to leave it at that and walks away a different way from hoshinomiya sensei   good enough for the time being despite having more questions","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p169-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: walking away<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.169<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The night-pool encounter ends; he leaves in the direction opposite hers.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji decides to leave it at that and walks away a different way from Hoshinomiya-sensei — good enough for the time being despite having more questions.<span class=\"pg\">p.169<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p167-1\">← Before: Ch.4 sec. 4.3: the drunk interruption<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p230-1\">→ After: Ch.5 sec. 5.2: the unlock authority<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p230-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 5 sec  5 2  the unlock authority ichinose cites her confirmation  with enough points the sim device lock releases immediately   i checked with hoshinomiya sensei to confirm  she said that with enough points  you can unlock the device right away  sim lock release is a point purchase   the loophole that makes the double swap work on a ship at sea  he had already paid for the same unlock on karuizawa s phone  named only  no scene presence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p230-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 sec. 5.2: the unlock authority<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.230<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ichinose cites her confirmation: with enough points the SIM device lock releases immediately.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> “I checked with Hoshinomiya-sensei to confirm. She said that with enough points, you can unlock the device right away.”<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> SIM lock release is a point purchase — the loophole that makes the double swap work on a ship at sea.<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He had already paid for the same unlock on Karuizawa’s phone.<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named only; no scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4-p169-1\">← Before: Ch.4: walking away<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4_5-p180-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 6  a passing mention recalled in ayanokoji s memory as the teacher horikita was discussing student council business with on the day he met her  on the day he met horikita  she was talking to hoshinomiya sensei  class b s homeroom teacher  about student council business","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v4_5-p180-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: a passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.180<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Recalled in Ayanokōji&#x27;s memory as the teacher Horikita was discussing student council business with on the day he met her.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> On the day he met Horikita, she was talking to Hoshinomiya-sensei, Class B&#x27;s homeroom teacher, about student council business.<span class=\"pg\">p.180<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v7-p73-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 3  the old teasing  cited old friend of chabashira  her comment about wanting to  be dominated by a younger man  is ayanokoji s key to the teacher s class a hunger  the friend who knew the hidden desire first","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v7-p73-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: the old teasing, cited<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.73<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Old friend of Chabashira; her comment about wanting to “be dominated by a younger man” is Ayanokōji’s key to the teacher’s Class A hunger.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> The friend who knew the hidden desire first.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p8-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami nagumo-miyabi hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie named as ichinose s homeroom teacher during the prologue interview  nagumo cites information obtained from ichinose s homeroom teacher  identified as ichinose s homeroom teacher  reported her entrance exam results to nagumo   i heard from your homeroom teacher  hoshinomiya sensei  looks like your results on the entrance exams were also outstanding  hoshinomiya does not appear in person  only named as the source of nagumo s information","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Named as Ichinose’s homeroom teacher<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.8<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">During the prologue interview, Nagumo cites information obtained from Ichinose’s homeroom teacher.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> “I heard from your homeroom teacher, Hoshinomiya-sensei. Looks like your results on the entrance exams were also outstanding.”<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Identified as Ichinose’s homeroom teacher; reported her entrance-exam results to Nagumo.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Hoshinomiya does not appear in person; only named as the source of Nagumo’s information.<span class=\"pg\">p.8<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p180-1\">→ After: The school’s intervention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p180-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie the school s intervention enters class b with nagumo and chabashira  present as class b s homeroom teacher during the intervention","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p180-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The school’s intervention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.180<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Enters Class B with Nagumo and Chabashira.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Present as Class B’s homeroom teacher during the intervention.<span class=\"pg\">p.180<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v9-p8-1\">← Before: Named as Ichinose’s homeroom teacher<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v10-p252-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 6  listening to ichinose as homeroom teacher listens to ichinose speak to class b after school  she feels uneasy about the exam and worries about the class unity being damaged by an expulsion  listens as ichinose assures the class no one will be expelled","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v10-p252-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: Listening to Ichinose<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.252–253<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">As homeroom teacher listens to Ichinose speak to Class B after school; she feels uneasy about the exam and worries about the class unity being damaged by an expulsion.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Listens as Ichinose assures the class no one will be expelled.<span class=\"pg\">p.252–253<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p14-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae mashima-tomonari tsukishiro hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 1  after the staff meeting watches as mashima challenges acting director tsukishiro in the staff meeting  talks with chabashira and mashima in the hallway  saying it is depressing that someone will be expelled  suggests tsukishiro may be trying to remove teachers who oppose him  teases chabashira about closing the gap and presses her about reaching class a  insists with chabashira that she has not brought personal feelings into the exams  after chabashira leaves  tells mashima she has gotten over the past but chabashira has not  says she has ichinose on her side and will not go easy on chabashira if class c gets close  talks with her about the exam and their rivalry  talks with him after the meeting  suspects his actions may target opposing teachers   it s depressing  isn t it  we have to announce an exam where someone s gonna get expelled   i wonder who s gonna disappear   you mean  overriding the expulsion with twenty million points  right   well  you re not alone on that  sae chan  he just popped up out of nowhere and  like  started doing whatever super unreasonable thing he wanted  didn t he   no way  sae chan  you re not fantasizing that your class might make it all the way to class a  are you   of course not  right  sae chan   don t lump me in with her  mashima kun  i ve already gotten over any lingering attachments i had  but that girl hasn t changed at all since back then  she ll never be able to move past her days as a student  that s why she s still stuck up on that good for nothing first love of hers  but she would never admit to that   you may be right  but i m not too worried since i have ichinose san on my side  besides   if they seem like they re getting close to reaching us  i ll pummel them back down myself","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p14-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: After the staff meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.14–26<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Watches as Mashima challenges Acting Director Tsukishiro in the staff meeting. Talks with Chabashira and Mashima in the hallway, saying it is depressing that someone will be expelled. Suggests Tsukishiro may be trying to remove teachers who oppose him. Teases Chabashira about closing the gap and presses her about reaching Class A. Insists with Chabashira that she has not brought personal feelings into the exams. After Chabashira leaves, tells Mashima she has gotten over the past but Chabashira has not. Says she has Ichinose on her side and will not go easy on Chabashira if Class C gets close.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“It’s depressing, isn’t it? We have to announce an exam where someone’s gonna get expelled.”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I wonder who’s gonna disappear…”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“You mean, overriding the expulsion with twenty million points, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Talks with her about the exam and their rivalry.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Talks with him after the meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Suspects his actions may target opposing teachers.<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, you’re not alone on that, Sae-chan. He just popped up out of nowhere and, like, started doing whatever super unreasonable thing he wanted, didn’t he?”<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No way… Sae-chan, you’re not fantasizing that your class might make it all the way to Class A, are you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Of course not. Right, Sae-chan?”<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Don’t lump me in with her, Mashima-kun. I’ve already gotten over any lingering attachments I had. But that girl hasn’t changed at all since back then. She’ll never be able to move past her days as a student. That’s why she’s still stuck up on that good-for-nothing first love of hers, but she would never admit to that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You may be right, but I’m not too worried since I have Ichinose-san on my side. Besides…”<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If they seem like they’re getting close to reaching us, I’ll pummel them back down myself.”<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p67-1\">→ After: Ch.3: Commanders’ meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p67-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 3  commanders  meeting attends the commanders  meeting and reacts playfully with ichinose during the interface demonstration  jokes with her during the explanation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p67-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Commanders’ meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.67<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Attends the commanders’ meeting and reacts playfully with Ichinose during the interface demonstration.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Jokes with her during the explanation.<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p14-1\">← Before: Ch.1: After the staff meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p159-1\">→ After: Ch.4: Talking with Ayanokōji before school<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p159-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka chabashira-sae sakayanagi-arisu hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 4  talking with ayanokoji before school calls out cheerfully to ayanokoji on the way to school and stops him to talk  asks about his relationship status and teases him while holding his hand  tells him the co ed dorm environment is ideal for romance and complains about boys and girls living in the same dormitory  shares a story about company room sharing to argue that single rooms encourage relationships  asks ayanokoji about dating across rival classes and says drama would make competition more exciting  stops the conversation when chabashira arrives and teases her  remarks that the special exam will show what ayanokoji can do against sakayanagi  approaches and talks with him on the way to school  teases her when she intervenes  mentions her as ayanokoji s opponent in the special exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p159-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: Talking with Ayanokōji before school<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.159–168<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Calls out cheerfully to Ayanokōji on the way to school and stops him to talk. Asks about his relationship status and teases him while holding his hand. Tells him the co-ed dorm environment is ideal for romance and complains about boys and girls living in the same dormitory. Shares a story about company room sharing to argue that single rooms encourage relationships. Asks Ayanokōji about dating across rival classes and says drama would make competition more exciting. Stops the conversation when Chabashira arrives and teases her. Remarks that the special exam will show what Ayanokōji can do against Sakayanagi.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Approaches and talks with him on the way to school.<span class=\"pg\">p.159–168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Teases her when she intervenes.<span class=\"pg\">p.167–168<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Mentions her as Ayanokōji’s opponent in the special exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p67-1\">← Before: Ch.3: Commanders’ meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p328-1\">→ After: Ch.7: Proctoring the exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p328-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 7  proctoring the exam helps facilitate the special exam for class a and class c in the multipurpose room  prompts ayanokoji and sakayanagi to take their seats as the exam begins  comments on the matchup and is reprimanded for speaking out of turn  reacts in amazement at the difficulty of the flash mental arithmetic questions","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p328-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: Proctoring the exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.328–362<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Helps facilitate the special exam for Class A and Class C in the multipurpose room. Prompts Ayanokōji and Sakayanagi to take their seats as the exam begins. Comments on the matchup and is reprimanded for speaking out of turn. Reacts in amazement at the difficulty of the Flash Mental Arithmetic questions.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p159-1\">← Before: Ch.4: Talking with Ayanokōji before school<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p332-1\">→ After: Ch.7: Proctoring the exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p332-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 7  proctoring the exam tells the commanders to take a seat   okaaay  the exam will begin any second now  please take a seat  says it is a shame ayanokoji faces sakayanagi   anywho  ayanokoji kun  it sure is a shame that you re gonna haveta go up against somebody like sakayanagi san  calls sakayanagi merciless   uwaa  sakayanagi san is soooo merciless  proctors the exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p332-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: Proctoring the exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.332, 334–335, 338<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Tells the commanders to take a seat. Says it is a shame Ayanokōji faces Sakayanagi. Calls Sakayanagi merciless.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Okaaay, the exam will begin any second now~ Please take a seat~”<span class=\"pg\">p.332<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Anywho, Ayanokōji-kun~ It sure is a shame that you’re gonna haveta go up against somebody like Sakayanagi-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.334<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Uwaa~ Sakayanagi-san is soooo merciless!”<span class=\"pg\">p.335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Proctors the exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.334–335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p328-1\">← Before: Ch.7: Proctoring the exam<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p403-1\">→ After: Epilogue: Proctoring the final event<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p403-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakagami-kazuma tsukishiro hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie epilogue  proctoring the final event offers water to the commanders before the chess event and observes the tense atmosphere  reacts in awe at the high level of the commander chess battle  consoles ayanokoji after class c s loss and remarks on the abilities he displayed  quietly warns ayanokoji that she may come to hate him if he becomes an enemy  helps with cleanup after being instructed by tsukishiro and sakagami  observes him during the exam and comments on his abilities afterward  proctors and cleans up alongside him  follows his instruction to leave and let staff handle cleanup","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p403-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Proctoring the final event<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.403–432<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Offers water to the commanders before the chess event and observes the tense atmosphere. Reacts in awe at the high level of the commander chess battle. Consoles Ayanokōji after Class C’s loss and remarks on the abilities he displayed. Quietly warns Ayanokōji that she may come to hate him if he becomes an enemy. Helps with cleanup after being instructed by Tsukishiro and Sakagami.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Observes him during the exam and comments on his abilities afterward.<span class=\"pg\">p.403–431<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">sakagami-kazuma<\/b> Proctors and cleans up alongside him.<span class=\"pg\">p.403–432<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Follows his instruction to leave and let staff handle cleanup.<span class=\"pg\">p.432<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p332-1\">← Before: Ch.7: Proctoring the exam<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p430-1\">→ After: Epilogue: After the exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p430-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"sakagami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie epilogue  after the exam asks whether he hid his abilities   the heck  does this mean you ve been hiding your abilities until now  announces the exam is over   the exam is over  students  please leave the room as soon as possible  says the students are lucky to go home   the students are so lucky  aren t they  getting to go back home and all  cleans up with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p430-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: After the exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.430–431<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Asks whether he hid his abilities. Announces the exam is over. Says the students are lucky to go home.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sakagami.html\">Sakagami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“The heck? Does this mean you’ve been hiding your abilities until now?”<span class=\"pg\">p.430<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“The exam is over. Students, please leave the room as soon as possible.”<span class=\"pg\">p.431<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“The students are so lucky, aren’t they? Getting to go back home and all.”<span class=\"pg\">p.431<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakagami<\/b> Cleans up with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.431<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11-p403-1\">← Before: Epilogue: Proctoring the final event<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11_5-p47-1","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"","w":"tsukishiro sakayanagi-arisu ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 1  chess exam meeting participates in the meeting with ayanokoji  sakayanagi  tsukishiro  and other teachers concerning the chess exam  hears sakayanagi claim that ayanokoji was the original winner of the chess game and that the process was manipulated  takes part in the teachers  response as the issue of acting director tsukishiro s interference is pressed  confronts the acting director over exam interference  hears her accusation regarding the chess exam  present in the meeting involving his exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y1v11_5-p47-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Chess exam meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.47–87<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Participates in the meeting with Ayanokōji, Sakayanagi, Tsukishiro, and other teachers concerning the chess exam. Hears Sakayanagi claim that Ayanokōji was the original winner of the chess game and that the process was manipulated. Takes part in the teachers’ response as the issue of Acting Director Tsukishiro’s interference is pressed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Confronts the acting director over exam interference.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Hears her accusation regarding the chess exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Present in the meeting involving his exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–87<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v1-p344-1","v":"y2v1","y":2,"o":16,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie epilogue  mention mentioned in passing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v1-p344-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V1 · p.344<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned in passing.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p16-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya on stage with the watch the class 2 c homeroom teacher shares the briefing stage with mashima  she says nothing on mic  she comes up on stage and hands a digital wristwatch to mashima  a staff member fastens it with a special tool  the metrics appear on the screen  mashima briefly passes the microphone to her to demonstrate the warning alert while she fastens the watch  no line of hers prints  her watch is given in mashima s table b example while he explains the twelve tables  her watch would use table b with completely different designated areas  e g  d10  e9  f8  while his uses table a  d8  d7  c6  stage partner for the briefing  hands him the watch  she models table b","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p16-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hoshinomiya on stage with the watch<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.16–27<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The Class 2-C homeroom teacher shares the briefing stage with Mashima; she says nothing on-mic. She comes up on stage and hands a digital wristwatch to Mashima; a staff member fastens it with a special tool; the metrics appear on the screen. Mashima briefly passes the microphone to her to demonstrate the Warning Alert while she fastens the watch.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No line of hers prints; her watch is given in Mashima&#x27;s Table B example while he explains the twelve Tables.<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her watch would use Table B with completely different designated areas (e.g. D10, E9, F8) while his uses Table A (D8, D7, C6).<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Stage partner for the briefing; hands him the watch; she models Table B.<span class=\"pg\">p.23–24<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p62-1\">→ After: The C6 ambush: recruitment over a closed Task<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p62-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie the c6 ambush  recruitment over a closed task lies in wait in a tent at the c6 task site to escape the heat  with nearly 20 students around  registration for grip strength measurement has closed minutes ago  she sizes up ayanokoji as he arrives   you came all the way here  but unfortunately  registration closed up about five minutes ago  grabs his arm to keep him around  laments class 2 c s fall to c rank  probes his math perfect score and whether class 2 d holds secret outstanding students   oh don t be in such a hurry  feel free to sit back and watch for a while   don t you think it s wrong for a teacher to encroach on a student s time just for their own convenience   awh  c mon  don t exaggerate  you ll have oodles of time after this   my last designated area was d7  so it s more than possible that my next will be here in area c6  if that happens  will you take responsibility for causing me to lose out on the early bird bonus   c cruel  don t be like that ayanokoji kun  teasing is a no no  i just wanted to chat a lil  bit  that s all  it s like  i ve been feelin  pretty grumpy recently  so how  bout you sit back and hear me out   it s been since the end of term exam  yeah  since we ve talked one on one like this  that is   anywho  you ve been attracting a lotta attention recently  you know  i didn t think you were the type that liked standing out   i don t   then why d you get that perfect score in math  i mean like  i think it s pretty weird that you just went and got  em all right  there was even a problem that i wouldn t have been able to get   are there  hmm  are you like  guessing  even if i assume you re right here  i d expect them to be like  class a or b students at least  and what class are you in again  ayanokoji kun  a  b  c  oh that s right  class d  just say it out loud with me   class d  this might sound rude or something  but the first thing that comes to mind for me when i say it is a laughable place chock full of problem children  filled to the brim with nothing but defects  and yet you wanna tell me that there are kids with outrageous specs like you mixed in with all that   while i don t know about me  i think there are plenty of outstanding students in class 2 d  moreover  if you take a look at class 1 d  there are plenty of outstanding students there too  don t you think   uh  that s true and all  but like  the school s policies have changed a bit since last year  yeah","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p62-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The C6 ambush: recruitment over a closed Task<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.62–64<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Lies in wait in a tent at the C6 Task site to escape the heat, with nearly 20 students around; registration for Grip Strength Measurement has closed minutes ago; she sizes up Ayanokōji as he arrives. Grabs his arm to keep him around; laments Class 2-C’s fall to C rank; probes his math perfect score and whether Class 2-D holds secret outstanding students.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“You came all the way here, but unfortunately, registration closed up about five minutes ago.”<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Oh don’t be in such a hurry! Feel free to sit back and watch for a while~.”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “Don’t you think it’s wrong for a teacher to encroach on a student’s time just for their own convenience?”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Awh, c’mon~ Don’t exaggerate! You’ll have oodles of time after this~.”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “My last designated area was D7, so it’s more than possible that my next will be here in area C6. If that happens, will you take responsibility for causing me to lose out on the Early Bird Bonus?”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “C-cruel! Don’t be like that Ayanokōji-kun, teasing is a no-no~ I just wanted to chat a lil’ bit, that’s all. It’s like, I’ve been feelin’ pretty grumpy recently, so how ‘bout you sit back and hear me out?”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s been since the end-of-term exam, yeah? Since we’ve talked one-on-one like this, that is.”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Anywho, you’ve been attracting a lotta attention recently, you know? I didn’t think you were the type that liked standing out.”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t.”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then why’d you get that perfect score in math? I mean like, I think it’s pretty weird that you just went and got ‘em all right. There was even a problem that I wouldn’t have been able to get.”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Are there? Hmm… Are you like, guessing? Even if I assume you’re right here, I’d expect them to be like, Class A or B students at least. And what class are you in again, Ayanokōji-kun? A… B… C… Oh that’s right, Class D. Just say it out loud with me, ‘Class D’. This might sound rude or something, but the first thing that comes to mind for me when I say it is a laughable place chock full of problem children, filled to the brim with nothing but defects. And yet you wanna tell me that there are kids with outrageous specs like you mixed in with all that?”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “While I don’t know about me, I think there are plenty of outstanding students in Class 2-D. Moreover, if you take a look at Class 1-D, there are plenty of outstanding students there too, don’t you think?”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Uh… That’s true and all, but like… the school’s policies have changed a bit since last year, yeah?”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p16-1\">← Before: Hoshinomiya on stage with the watch<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p65-1\">→ After: The transfer pitch and Sudō’s first place<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p65-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka sudou-ken hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie the transfer pitch and sudo s first place the grip strength measurement task begins  sudo steps up without ike and hondo  she marvels at sudo s change and despairs over class 2 c  covers her ears at the exam duty suggestion   i ll agree that there are some outstanding class d kids out there  sure  but i don t think they re good enough to keep their class together or anything  when it comes to you though  i get the impression that you ve influenced your surroundings   anyway  i ve really like  lost my cool here  this is the first time i ve ever had a class go and drop down to class c like this  i dunno how to say it exactly  i mean  there always used to be an order to things  class a would compete with class b while class c and class d went at each other  you feel me   i really thought that this class would be the one to reach class a  but  well   isn t it your duty as the homeroom teacher to do something about that   what a cruel thing to say  pitches the katsuragi style transfer into class 2 c   her  revolutionary  idea  her hand drifts toward him  he refuses with 20 million point math and the class a uncertainty  sudo takes first  neither oshio nor anyone touches his score  she notes his growth and finally lets him go   ah  me  me  you know what  sensei s got a totally revolutionary idea for you  just like how katsuragi kun transferred to class 2 b  ayanokoji kun can transfer over to my class  how  bout it   i was wondering where you were going with this  you ve really put forward something outlandish  haven t you   you ll aim for class a together with us  right  right   i wouldn t be able to come up with 20 million points even if i saved up until the day i graduate  furthermore  as things are now  even if i found a way to prepare such a large number of points  there s no way to tell which class will be class a in the end  so don t you think it would be wiser to wait until the final moment and see how things play out instead   y you don t have to say it so impartially   sudo kun has changed an awful lot  don t cha think  i wonder who s responsible   just for the record  it wasn t me   there are two weeks until the end of the exam  i m prolly gonna get sent around the island a lot  so maybe we ll meet each other again  childlike  flirtatious and unfinished as an adult  the 2 c drop stings her  recruits ayanokoji with physical closeness  her pitch founders on his cold arithmetic  she lets him go with a pout  ambushes him at the task site  pitches the transfer  he refuses  she marks their next encounter for the island  watches sudo s first place grip  wonders who is responsible for his change","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The transfer pitch and Sudō’s first place<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.65–67<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The Grip Strength Measurement Task begins; Sudō steps up without Ike and Hondō; she marvels at Sudō’s change and despairs over Class 2-C; covers her ears at the exam-duty suggestion. Pitches the Katsuragi-style transfer into Class 2-C — her “revolutionary” idea; her hand drifts toward him; he refuses with 20-million-point math and the Class-A uncertainty; Sudō takes first (neither Oshio nor anyone touches his score); she notes his growth and finally lets him go.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’ll agree that there are some outstanding Class D kids out there, sure, but I don’t think they’re good enough to keep their class together or anything. When it comes to you though, I get the impression that you’ve influenced…”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Anyway, I’ve really like, lost my cool here. This is the first time I’ve ever had a class go and drop down to Class C like this. I dunno how to say it exactly. I mean, there always used to be an order to things. Class A would…”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I really thought that this class would be the one to reach Class A, but… well…”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>15 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’ll agree that there are some outstanding Class D kids out there, sure, but I don’t think they’re good enough to keep their class together or anything. When it comes to you though, I get the impression that you’ve influenced your surroundings.”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Anyway, I’ve really like, lost my cool here. This is the first time I’ve ever had a class go and drop down to Class C like this. I dunno how to say it exactly. I mean, there always used to be an order to things. Class A would compete with Class B while Class C and Class D went at each other, you feel me~?”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Isn’t it your duty as the homeroom teacher to do something about that?”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “What a cruel thing to say~!”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ah! Me, me! You know what, Sensei’s got a totally revolutionary idea for you! Just like how Katsuragi-kun transferred to Class 2-B, Ayanokōji-kun can transfer over to my class! How ‘bout it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I was wondering where you were going with this. You’ve really put forward something outlandish, haven’t you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You’ll aim for Class A together with us, right? Right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I wouldn’t be able to come up with 20 million points even if I saved up until the day I graduate. Furthermore, as things are now, even if I found a way to prepare such a large number of points, there’s no way to tell which class will be Class A in the end. So don’t you think it would be wiser to wait until the final moment and see how things play out instead?”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Y-you don’t have to say it so impartially…”<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sudō-kun has changed an awful lot, don’t cha think? I wonder who’s responsible.”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Just for the record, it wasn’t me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There are two weeks until the end of the exam. I’m prolly gonna get sent around the island a lot, so maybe we’ll meet each other again~.”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Childlike, flirtatious and unfinished-as-an-adult; the 2-C drop stings her; recruits Ayanokōji with physical closeness; her pitch founders on his cold arithmetic; she lets him go with a pout.<span class=\"pg\">p.62–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Ambushes him at the Task site; pitches the transfer; he refuses; she marks their next encounter for the island.<span class=\"pg\">p.62–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Watches Sudō’s first-place grip; wonders who is responsible for his change.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–67<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v3-p62-1\">← Before: The C6 ambush: recruitment over a closed Task<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p10-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie relations in this volume  depth pass  she vomits over the deck railing in front of horikita  horikita rates the display a teaching moment  not a mystery","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Relations in this volume (depth pass)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.10–290<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She vomits over the deck railing in front of Horikita; Horikita rates the display a teaching moment, not a mystery.<span class=\"pg\">p.243–244<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p225-1\">→ After: Hoshinomiya drinks: the exam that ruined Class A<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p225-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae mashima-tomonari ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya drinks  the exam that ruined class a slumped face down on the bar at 1 a m  demanding a strong drink  master s choice    exhausted from the island exam and bitter that teachers get no summer vacation   ahh  i m so tired  why do we teachers have to work so late  day in and   please give me a drink strong enough for me to escape from reality  master s choice   oh my  you ve started talking big all of a sudden  sae chan   how long are you going to chase after your boring love   do you know how old we are now  we re 29 you know  i m saying that romance was years ago   i definitely wasn t at fault it was all sae chan s fault   i absolutely won t let sae chan s class graduate from class a   you need to become a demon to win class a  just like i tried to do   hirata  kushida  horikita  koenji  ayanokoji no matter how much i think about it  it s too unfair  childlike and resentful   drinks herself increasingly drunk  fourth  fifth glass  blames chabashira for failing to graduate class a 11 years ago  if sae chan had chosen the right answer  we would ve graduated from class a  refuses to let chabashira s class graduate class a out of spite  and hopes the next exam smashes their  solidarity  later hangs on mashima and makes him take her home  her old classmate and rival   holds a grudge over the special exam that cost them class a 11 years ago  tries to get her to sleep in her own room  she clings to him  believes her class is  not good enough  to win class a","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p225-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hoshinomiya drinks: the exam that ruined Class A<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.225–236<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Slumped face-down on the bar at 1 a.m., demanding a strong drink (&quot;master&#x27;s choice&quot;) — exhausted from the island exam and bitter that teachers get no summer vacation.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Ahh, I&#x27;m so tired. Why do we teachers have to work so late, day in and&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Please give me a drink strong enough for me to escape from reality. Master&#x27;s choice.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Oh my? You&#x27;ve started talking big all of a sudden, Sae-chan.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;How long are you going to chase after your boring love?!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Do you know how old we are now? We&#x27;re 29 you know? I&#x27;m saying that romance was years ago!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I definitely wasn&#x27;t at fault…It was all Sae-chan&#x27;s fault…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I absolutely won&#x27;t let Sae-chan&#x27;s class graduate from Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.235<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;you need to become a demon to win Class A. Just like I tried to do.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.235<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Hirata, Kushida, Horikita, Kōenji, Ayanokōji…No matter how much I think about it, it&#x27;s too unfair.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.235<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Childlike and resentful — drinks herself increasingly drunk (fourth, fifth glass), blames Chabashira for failing to graduate Class A 11 years ago (&quot;if Sae-chan had chosen the right answer, we would&#x27;ve graduated from Class A&quot;), refuses to let Chabashira&#x27;s class graduate Class A out of spite, and hopes the next exam smashes their &quot;solidarity&quot;; later hangs on Mashima and makes him take her home.<span class=\"pg\">p.225–236<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Her old classmate and rival — holds a grudge over the special exam that cost them Class A 11 years ago.<span class=\"pg\">p.225–235<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Tries to get her to sleep in her own room; she clings to him.<span class=\"pg\">p.236<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Believes her class is &quot;not good enough&quot; to win Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.235<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p10-1\">← Before: Relations in this volume (depth pass)<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p243-1\">→ After: Hoshinomiya vomits on deck in front of Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p243-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji ishigami-kyo-1a hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya vomits on deck in front of horikita appears at the private pool reception looking  unwell   a disease specific to adults  kanzaki is with her  she sees ishigami leaving and vomits over the deck railing  blaming a mix of hangover and seasickness  she bolts back into the ship   um  are you feeling unwell    that is horikita s line   ohh  this  don t worry about it  it s a disease specific to adults   bluurrgghhhh   agh  ugghh  eek   ugh  it s a mix of hangover and seasickness  sowwy  horikitasa bluurrgghh  delivers her embarrassing behavior with him in tow  she recognizes him as hoshinomiya s class talent  the  clever face  she half remembers the cool kid from before as ishigami    i think i saw him at school once a while ago  but maybe i saw wrong","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p243-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hoshinomiya vomits on deck in front of Horikita<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.243–244<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears at the private-pool reception looking &quot;unwell&quot; (a disease specific to adults); Kanzaki is with her; she sees Ishigami leaving and vomits over the deck railing, blaming a mix of hangover and seasickness; she bolts back into the ship.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"ishigami-kyo-1a.html\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Um, are you feeling unwell?” — that is Horikita&#x27;s line.<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ohh~ this? Don&#x27;t worry about it; it&#x27;s a disease specific to adults.”<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Bluurrgghhhh!!”<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Agh, ugghh, eek!”<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ugh, it&#x27;s a mix of hangover and seasickness, sowwy, Horikitasa──Bluurrgghh!”<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Delivers her embarrassing behavior with him in tow; she recognizes him as Hoshinomiya&#x27;s class talent (the &quot;clever face&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.243–245<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō (Class 1-A)<\/b> She half-remembers the cool kid from before as Ishigami — &quot;I think I saw him at school once a while ago, but…maybe I saw wrong.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v4_5-p225-1\">← Before: Hoshinomiya drinks: the exam that ruined Class A<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p7-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie coverage gate mention record  my best friend  chie  approaches me with an angry expression and grabs my chest    chabashira s nightmare  chie s first appearance in this volume  the dream s pov   p 34   p 36   p 82   p 96   p 112   p 114   p 116   p 155   p 161   p 177   p 178   p 180   p 206    locator hits on those pages are substring noise  the pattern  chie  matches inside  achieve achievable achieved    no chie references exist on those pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Coverage-gate mention record<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.7<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;My best friend, Chie, approaches me with an angry expression and grabs my chest.&quot; — Chabashira&#x27;s nightmare; Chie&#x27;s first appearance in this volume; the dream&#x27;s POV.<span class=\"pg\">p.7<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> (p.34) (p.36) (p.82) (p.96) (p.112) (p.114) (p.116) (p.155) (p.161) (p.177) (p.178) (p.180) (p.206) — locator hits on those pages are substring noise: the pattern &quot;chie&quot; matches inside &quot;achieve&quot;/&quot;achievable&quot;/&quot;achieved&quot; — no Chie references exist on those pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p78-1\">→ After: Chie spots Chabashira&#x27;s collapse coming<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p78-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae ikari-sensei hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie chie spots chabashira s collapse coming  um  i know it s a little late  but do you have a minute    adjacent narration  the reply addresses  hoshinomiya sensei   as i recall  the last time this exam was held  11 years ago  a measure was taken to shuffle the teachers so that they would not be assigned to the same class  right   so why is it that this time the homeroom teacher is still looking after their own class  if you are concerned about fairness  i think you should change it   that s what i thought   sure  whatever  i m somewhat convinced  so please proceed   it s finally here  sae chan   you couldn t sleep last night because you were thinking about the special exam  right   whatever  just know that sae chan doesn t have the qualifications to aim for class a   sae chan  is her nickname for chabashira  the personal edge to her lines is openly resentment   not aimed at chabashira s students  but at chie s standing as the better class person  her oldest sparring partner  the one who spots the insomnia and calls it out  audits  she provokes  he answers","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p78-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Chie spots Chabashira&#x27;s collapse coming<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.78–80<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#ikari-sensei\">Ikari-sensei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Um, I know it&#x27;s a little late, but do you have a minute?&quot; — adjacent narration: the reply addresses &quot;Hoshinomiya-sensei&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;As I recall, the last time this exam was held... 11 years ago, a measure was taken to shuffle the teachers so that they would not be assigned to the same class, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;So why is it that this time the homeroom teacher is still looking after their own class? If you are concerned about fairness, I think you should change it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s what I thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Sure, whatever. I&#x27;m somewhat convinced, so please proceed.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s finally here, Sae-chan.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You couldn&#x27;t sleep last night because you were thinking about the special exam, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Whatever, just know that Sae-chan doesn&#x27;t have the qualifications to aim for Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> &quot;Sae-chan&quot; is her nickname for Chabashira; the personal edge to her lines is openly resentment — not aimed at Chabashira&#x27;s students, but at Chie&#x27;s standing as the better-class person.<span class=\"pg\">p.76–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Her oldest sparring partner; the one who spots the insomnia and calls it out.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ikari-sensei<\/b> Audits; she provokes, he answers.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–79<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p7-1\">← Before: Coverage-gate mention record<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p127-1\">→ After: Hoshinomiya runs Class B&#x27;s exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p127-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya runs class b s exam operates her tablet announcing the first vote results   showing a somewhat disappointed look  the single  in favour  surprises her too  interrupts kanzaki s final appeal and starts the 60 second timer  the class silence is deafening  after another 30  minutes of stalemate  she opens her mouth   invites them to hear a story from her own school days  she also took this unanimous special exam  the content of the fifth question was exactly the same   actually  when i was a student  i had the same experience as everyone else   because i ve also taken this unanimous special exam   and the content of the fifth question was exactly the same as now   me  i made the choice to  cut out the unnecessary people  of course   i can t say much more because i m being watched closely behind me   i will respect you all  whichever choice you make   but definitely don t just make vague and ambiguous decisions   yes  everyone  the other classes are in the middle of their special exams  so please don t disturb them  the teacher will guide you now  so please get out of your seats quietly   the answer given by 40 people was    the tally anomaly  39 classmates  the print does not explain the 40th vote  hoshinomiya in particular was not surprised when the results shifted zero votes  kept as printed  nine years into this teaching career she meets the same question with a heartfelt story that guides nothing   she is the closest thing this school has to a veteran of the exam  and she cannot bend the rules for them  she exits the class quietly and makes no public comment on the anomaly  her brightest student   the class s beacon  she loves her  her  general advisor  who votes against her class  she will not endorse him  she merely watches","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p127-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hoshinomiya runs Class B&#x27;s exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.127–139<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Operates her tablet announcing the first-vote results — showing a somewhat disappointed look; the single &quot;in favour&quot; surprises her too. Interrupts Kanzaki&#x27;s final appeal and starts the 60-second timer; the class silence is deafening. After another 30+ minutes of stalemate, she opens her mouth — invites them to hear a story from her own school days: she also took this unanimous special exam; the content of the fifth question was exactly the same.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Actually, when I was a student, I had the same experience as everyone else.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.135<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Because I&#x27;ve also taken this unanimous special exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.135<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;And the content of the fifth question was exactly the same as now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.135<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Me? I made the choice to... cut out the unnecessary people, of course.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.136<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I can&#x27;t say much more because I&#x27;m being watched closely behind me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I will respect you all, whichever choice you make.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;But definitely don&#x27;t just make vague and ambiguous decisions.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Yes, everyone~. The other classes are in the middle of their special exams, so please don&#x27;t disturb them. The teacher will guide you now, so please get out of your seats quietly.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> &quot;The answer given by 40 people was...&quot; — the tally anomaly (39 classmates; the print does not explain the 40th vote); Hoshinomiya in particular was not surprised when the results shifted zero votes. Kept as printed.<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nine years into this teaching career she meets the same question with a heartfelt story that guides nothing — she is the closest thing this school has to a veteran of the exam, and she cannot bend the rules for them; she exits the class quietly and makes no public comment on the anomaly.<span class=\"pg\">p.127–139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her brightest student — the class&#x27;s beacon; she loves her.<span class=\"pg\">p.127–139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Her &quot;general advisor&quot; who votes against her class; she will not endorse him; she merely watches.<span class=\"pg\">p.127–135<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v5-p78-1\">← Before: Chie spots Chabashira&#x27;s collapse coming<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v6-p336-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie short story   something that can t be forgiven   chie   from chabashira s pov  she runs down the hallway    sa e chan  yah ho  chabashira warns her    how are you going to set an example if even you are running full ahead   bu ut  i saw you right ahead  she heard the horikita talk   even the model student horikita has lots of worries   why have you gotten closer to your students now   it is  you are not that kind of a teacher  you have never been until now  have you   i won t acknowledge it  there is no way sae chan would ever act like a teacher  chabashira s reply never reaches her   sa e chan  yah ho   bu ut  i saw you right ahead   by the way  you were taking quite a long time talking with horikita san   looks like even the model student horikita has lots of worries   she s just a child  right  but that s not what i wanted to say   why have you gotten closer to your students now   it is  you are not that kind of a teacher  you have never been until now  have you   i won t acknowledge it  there is no way sae chan would ever act like a teacher  she knows her   she does not buy the act  her reply never reaches her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v6-p336-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Short story: “Something That Can’t be Forgiven” (Chie — from Chabashira&#x27;s POV)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.336–338<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She runs down the hallway — “Sa~~~~e-chan. Yah-ho!”; Chabashira warns her — “How are you going to set an example if even you are running full ahead?”; “Bu~ut, I saw you right ahead!”; she heard the Horikita talk; “even the model student Horikita has lots of worries.”; “Why have you gotten closer to your students now?”; “It is. You are not that kind of a teacher. You have never been until now, have you?”; “I won’t acknowledge it. There is no way Sae-chan would ever act like a teacher.”; Chabashira&#x27;s reply never reaches her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Sa~~~~e-chan. Yah-ho!”<span class=\"pg\">p.336<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Bu~ut, I saw you right ahead!”<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“By the way, you were taking quite a long time talking with Horikita-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Looks like even the model student Horikita has lots of worries.”<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “She’s just a child, right? But that’s not what I wanted to say.”<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Why have you gotten closer to your students now?”<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It is. You are not that kind of a teacher. You have never been until now, have you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.337<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I won’t acknowledge it. There is no way Sae-chan would ever act like a teacher.”<span class=\"pg\">p.338<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> She knows her — she does not buy the act; her reply never reaches her.<span class=\"pg\">p.336–338<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v7-p157-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie chabashira suggests her  well  wait  yes  why don t you ask chie  she does this kind of thing better  she d be ready to do it even for a rival class    chabashira sensei   i m sure she would  but what i m looking for now is not someone who can do this dexterously  but rather someone who is clumsy    the chie suggestion is refused  chie   hoshinomiya chie  rostered  aliases hoshinomiya and chie  named by chabashira sensei  the text prints her as  chie  assignment per the roster s chie alias is reasonable but not guaranteed  not assigned as outright identity  flagged  the chie suggestion falls flat","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v7-p157-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Chabashira suggests her<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.157<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “Well, wait. Yes, why don&#x27;t you ask Chie? She does this kind of thing better. She&#x27;d be ready to do it even for a rival class.” — Chabashira-sensei; “I&#x27;m sure she would. But what I&#x27;m looking for now is not someone who can do this dexterously, but rather someone who is clumsy.” — the Chie suggestion is refused.<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Chie — Hoshinomiya Chie (rostered; aliases hoshinomiya and chie); named by Chabashira-sensei; the text prints her as &quot;Chie&quot;; assignment per the roster&#x27;s Chie alias is reasonable but not guaranteed; not assigned as outright identity; flagged.<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> The Chie suggestion falls flat.<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p11-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya chie mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mentions on pages  p 46  p 49  p 148  p 155 158  p 202 203  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">hoshinomiya-chie mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.11-208<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions on pages: p.46, p.49, p.148, p.155-158, p.202-203.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p46-1\">→ After: Boarding bus No.4 (Class D)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p46-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie boarding bus no 4  class d  hoshinomiya sensei boards no 4  by class order a to d","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Boarding bus No.4 (Class D)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.46<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Hoshinomiya-sensei boards No.4 (by class order A to D).<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p11-1\">← Before: hoshinomiya-chie mentioned in passing<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p49-1\">→ After: The bus assignments<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p49-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie the bus assignments  hoshinomiya sensei was in charge of groups 16 through 20   the ski group teacher assignments","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p49-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The bus assignments<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.49<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;Hoshinomiya-sensei was in charge of groups 16 through 20&quot; (the ski-group teacher assignments)<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p46-1\">← Before: Boarding bus No.4 (Class D)<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p153-1\">→ After: The second-floor master of ceremony<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p153-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie the second floor master of ceremony she monopolizes the massage chairs  she s drunk and deflated  everything that comes out of her is a confession in card game form  the words  the only one with a joker  escape with all the damage attached  she storms out declaring they would have him by now otherwise  she blows the whole night out   too bad  tonight we re kind of on a half day off  right  sae chan   as you get older and more mature  massages become indispensable  there are a lot of hardships that you young people wouldn t understand   especially in sae chan s case  her shoulders are very stiff   by the way  horikita san  you ve totally become a leader  are you still comfortable in class b  ah  how could a former homeroom teacher of class b ask you such a question   indeed  i think horikita san s class is making remarkable progress  class b is just a stopping point  and you need to aim for class a  it s obvious  but i think that s wonderful and very admirable too   it doesn t matter  i m just trying to say what i think   mhhh   then i ll speak freely  as a homeroom teacher with a class  i have always thought that teachers from class a to class d are also competing with each other   if a student with only 3s clashes with a student with 6s  of course the student with 6s wins   in mashima s class a  the cards in his hand are all in order  and he is dealt more 10s and 11s   of course the students change from day to day  i m sure some who were worth 3 or 4 will grow up and become 12 or 13  or in rare cases  the strongest number  2  so class fluctuations do happen  and sometimes class d can move up to class b  well  it s extremely rare though   but the important thing is to fight equally  every class is always fighting within the numbers 1 through 13  you don t want there to be any unfairness or cheating in any particular class  do you   but you know what  don t you think there s one card in your class that shouldn t be mixed in   yes  it s cheating  sae chan s class is the only one with a joker   you must be tempted to argue  even if i m trying my best to use my head and fight  a single joker will turn the situation upside down  no  it s much worse than playing daifugo  because you can play the joker over and over and over again  unlike the other games where you use it once and it s gone from your hand  there s no way we can win   i see  sorry  sorry  maybe i got a little drunk from the massage   you got the joker because you and sae were lucky  it s not cheating if you use it to reach class a  right   i m going back to my room  sayonara  a drunk player with the honesty of a truther  the daifugo monologue is her whole philosophy of teaching as competition  she hears everything she says and hates herself for saying it  they spar with shushi s old teammates  ease  she withdraws with grace exits","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p153-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The second-floor master of ceremony<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.153–159<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She monopolizes the massage chairs; she&#x27;s drunk and deflated; everything that comes out of her is a confession in card-game form; the words &quot;the only one with a joker&quot; escape with all the damage attached; she storms out declaring they would have him by now otherwise; she blows the whole night out.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Too bad~ Tonight we&#x27;re kind of on a half day off~ Right, Sae-chan?”<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“As you get older and more mature, massages become indispensable. There are a lot of hardships that you young people wouldn&#x27;t understand.”<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Especially in Sae-chan&#x27;s case, her shoulders are very stiff.”<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>17 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “By the way, Horikita-san, you&#x27;ve totally become a leader. Are you still comfortable in Class B? Ah, how could a former homeroom teacher of Class B ask you such a question?”<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Indeed, I think Horikita-san&#x27;s class is making remarkable progress; Class B is just a stopping point, and you need to aim for Class A. It&#x27;s obvious, but I think that&#x27;s wonderful and very admirable too.”<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It doesn&#x27;t matter. I&#x27;m just trying to say what I think.”<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Mhhh~.”<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then I&#x27;ll speak freely. As a homeroom teacher with a class, I have always thought that teachers from Class A to Class D are also competing with each other.”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If a student with only 3s clashes with a student with 6s, of course the student with 6s wins.”<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In Mashima&#x27;s Class A, the cards in his hand are all in order, and he is dealt more 10s and 11s.”<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Of course the students change from day to day; I&#x27;m sure some who were worth 3 or 4 will grow up and become 12 or 13, or in rare cases, the strongest number, 2. So class fluctuations do happen, and sometimes Class D can move up to Class B. Well, it&#x27;s extremely rare though.”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “But the important thing is to fight equally. Every class is always fighting within the numbers 1 through 13. You don&#x27;t want there to be any unfairness or cheating in any particular class, do you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “But you know what? Don&#x27;t you think there&#x27;s one card in your class that shouldn&#x27;t be mixed in?”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Yes, it&#x27;s cheating. Sae-chan&#x27;s class is the only one with a joker.”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You must be tempted to argue. Even if I&#x27;m trying my best to use my head and fight, a single joker will turn the situation upside down. No, it&#x27;s much worse than playing Daifugō. Because you can play the joker over and over and over again, unlike the other games where you use it once and it&#x27;s gone from your hand. There&#x27;s no way we can win.”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I see. Sorry, sorry. Maybe I got a little drunk from the massage.”<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You got the joker because you and Sae were lucky. It&#x27;s not cheating if you use it to reach Class A, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I&#x27;m going back to my room! Sayonara!”<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A drunk player with the honesty of a truther; the Daifugō monologue is her whole philosophy of teaching as competition; she hears everything she says and hates herself for saying it.<span class=\"pg\">p.153–159<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> They spar with Shushi&#x27;s old teammates&#x27; ease; she withdraws with grace exits.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–159<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p49-1\">← Before: The bus assignments<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p202-1\">→ After: Named in the Chabashira SS<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p202-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie named in the chabashira ss  confused and enlightened  retells the drunk chie scene  she shouts  i m going back to my room  bye  and leaves  chabashira regrets it immediately and sets off after her  if i leave her alone she might drink until dawn","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p202-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Named in the Chabashira SS<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.202–203<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;Confused and Enlightened&quot; retells the drunk Chie scene: she shouts &quot;I&#x27;m going back to my room! Bye!&quot; and leaves; Chabashira regrets it immediately and sets off after her (&quot;if I leave her alone she might drink until dawn&quot;).<span class=\"pg\">p.202–203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v8-p153-1\">← Before: The second-floor master of ceremony<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v9_5-p59-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 3  teachers  christmas eve at the mall approaches ayanokoji first  are you alone  teases him about not being with a girlfriend  says it s annoying for younger students to have lovers on christmas  off to karaoke with chabashira   oh  are you alone   don t tease the students  chie  besides  karuizawa has the flu  claims she can now understand sae s feelings about being alone on christmas  constant bickering partners  karaoke trip together on the 25th  sizes up his holiday solitude with a pointed jab","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v9_5-p59-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Teachers&#x27; Christmas Eve at the mall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.59–60<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Approaches Ayanokōji first (&quot;Are you alone?&quot;), teases him about not being with a girlfriend; says it&#x27;s annoying for younger students to have lovers on Christmas; off to karaoke with Chabashira.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Oh? Are you alone?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Don&#x27;t tease the students, Chie. Besides, Karuizawa has the flu.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Claims she can now understand Sae&#x27;s feelings about being alone on Christmas.<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Constant bickering partners; karaoke trip together on the 25th.<span class=\"pg\">p.59–60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Sizes up his holiday solitude with a pointed jab.<span class=\"pg\">p.59–60<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p9-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya chie mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mention  locator pages  p 50  p 97  p 119  p 128  p 144 147  p 163 164  not line by line verified  substring false positives possible  not a scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">hoshinomiya-chie mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.9-235<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention (locator pages: p.50, p.97, p.119, p.128, p.144-147, p.163-164; not line-by-line verified; substring false positives possible). Not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p144-1\">→ After: Ch.6: The teacher in the room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p144-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"spoken","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 6  the teacher in the room she supervises ryuen s class during the exam   at the podium  she calls the turns out  ryuen ignores her until the last possible second  she notices her students aren t panicking   she walks the room pretending to watch  peeking at their phones  ishizaki has fallen asleep   kaneda kun  it seems like you re not doing anything  are you fully prepared  she bursts out with relief at the lack of panic   she doesn t understand the situation  this class can t be shaken   everyone doesn t seem to be panicking at all  she takes heat for the delay   ryuen stalls at the podium  she attempts to move the turn forward  he pushes her aside gently   w wait  wait  wait  i ll input it quickly  she sits through turn 18 19    no  she doesn t have a seat on the podium anymore  she watches ryuen sweep through the turns  she is the homeroom teacher type who feels outclassed by her own students  strategy   the pages show her struggling to keep up with the tempo  no nonsense  observant  quietly defeated by the class s collective calm","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p144-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: The teacher in the room<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.144–153, 172–176<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She supervises Ryūen&#x27;s class during the exam — at the podium; she calls the turns out; Ryūen ignores her until the last possible second. She notices her students aren&#x27;t panicking — she walks the room pretending to watch, peeking at their phones; Ishizaki has fallen asleep. She bursts out with relief at the lack of panic — she doesn&#x27;t understand the situation; this class can&#x27;t be shaken. She takes heat for the delay — Ryūen stalls at the podium; she attempts to move the turn forward; he pushes her aside gently. She sits through turn 18-19? — no; she doesn&#x27;t have a seat on the podium anymore; she watches Ryūen sweep through the turns.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Kaneda-kun, it seems like you’re not doing anything. Are you fully prepared?”<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Everyone doesn’t seem to be panicking at all...”<span class=\"pg\">p.149<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“W-wait, wait, wait. I’ll input it quickly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.173<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She is the homeroom teacher type who feels outclassed by her own students&#x27; strategy — the pages show her struggling to keep up with the tempo.<span class=\"pg\">p.144<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> No-nonsense; observant; quietly defeated by the class&#x27;s collective calm.<span class=\"pg\">p.147, 149<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p9-1\">← Before: hoshinomiya-chie mentioned in passing<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p145-1\">→ After: Ch.6: passing mentions (locator cross-check)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p145-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 6  passing mentions  locator cross check  passing mention   hoshinomiya cheered them on  treating the fact that they couldn t withstand passing mention   hoshinomiya quickly finished inputting the names  but she was taken aback passing mention   hey  be respectful when addressing the teacher  hoshinomiya interjected","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p145-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: passing mentions (locator cross-check)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.145–175<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention — Hoshinomiya cheered them on, treating the fact that they couldn&#x27;t withstand<span class=\"pg\">p.145<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention — Hoshinomiya quickly finished inputting the names, but she was taken aback<span class=\"pg\">p.146<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention — Hey, be respectful when addressing the teacher, Hoshinomiya interjected,<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v10-p144-1\">← Before: Ch.6: The teacher in the room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p10-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie monologue  her motive a monologue printed before chapter 1  chie hoshinomiya recounts that sae chan  chabashira  was her best friend and rival  she became a teacher for one purpose   to eliminate all hope from sae s dream of graduating a class a  she traces her resentment to the day sae failed to graduate from class a eleven years ago  a tl note printed in line under her vow explains it literally reads  so as long as i can see  she swears that if her class loses the year end special exam and sae chan s class becomes class a  at worst she will stop it by any means necessary   even if she is branded a failure as a teacher and driven out of the profession  the monologue reframes everything that follows  her patience and her hostility toward ayanokoji in ch 3 both flow from this oath","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Monologue: her motive<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.10–11<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">A monologue printed before Chapter 1: Chie Hoshinomiya recounts that Sae-chan (Chabashira) was her best friend and rival; she became a teacher for one purpose — to eliminate all hope from Sae&#x27;s dream of graduating a Class A; she traces her resentment to the day Sae failed to graduate from Class A eleven years ago. She swears that if her class loses the year-end special exam and Sae-chan&#x27;s class becomes Class A, at worst she will stop it by any means necessary — even if she is branded a failure as a teacher and driven out of the profession.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> A TL NOTE printed in-line under her vow explains it literally reads &quot;So as long as I can see.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The monologue reframes everything that follows: her patience and her hostility toward Ayanokōji in Ch.3 both flow from this oath.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p65-1\">→ After: Ch.3: The body checks (Class B and D rooms)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p65-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"spoken","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 3  the body checks  class b and d rooms  sakagami and hoshinomiya sensei handle the body checks in the representatives  room  hoshinomiya begins the inspection from head to toes with a handheld device  probably a metal detector  working her way from ayanokoji to horikita   okay  don t move now  i m going to perform a body check  she says nothing else during the checks  her remaining lines appear on pp 84 86  in the hallway","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: The body checks (Class B and D rooms)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.65–66<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakagami and Hoshinomiya-sensei handle the body checks in the representatives&#x27; room; Hoshinomiya begins the inspection from head to toes with a handheld device, probably a metal detector, working her way from Ayanokōji to Horikita.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Okay, don’t move now. I’m going to perform a body check.”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She says nothing else during the checks; her remaining lines appear on pp.84–86, in the hallway.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p10-1\">← Before: Monologue: her motive<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p84-1\">→ After: Ch.3: The hallway offer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p84-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 3  the hallway offer right after the group lists are submitted  a hallway in the special building  she follows him out of the classroom as he heads for the restroom  closes the distance close enough to touch him without stretching her arm   going to the restroom  can i have a moment   it s surprising to see you coming out as a representative today  she bluntly admits this is her class s last chance   they are class d  she asks him to discreetly hold back and give her the win  when he refuses  she offers  something in return    then something only she can do   ending with her gently touching his ear   give me the win  i want you to discreetly hold back   what if i say i ll properly give you something in return   sae chan is the one i definitely can t lose to  for that  i m willing to do anything   you know what i mean  right  he steps back  tells her that what she can do now is believe in ichinose s class s victory  she counters  then you don t know what measures i might take  do you  he calls it interesting and leaves for the restroom   then you don t know what measures i might take  do you  per the printed tl note inside this scene     spat out saliva cannot be swallowed  glosses as  words once spoken cannot be taken back   sae chan is the one i definitely can t lose to    her nemesis from the prologue monologue  her willingness to do anything is aimed at sae s class s victory path  she recognizes he is unreadable    it s like  you can see right through my mind","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p84-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: The hallway offer<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.84–86<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Right after the group lists are submitted, a hallway in the special building; she follows him out of the classroom as he heads for the restroom; closes the distance close enough to touch him without stretching her arm. She bluntly admits this is her class&#x27;s last chance — they are Class D; she asks him to discreetly hold back and give her the win; when he refuses, she offers &quot;something in return&quot; — then something only she can do — ending with her gently touching his ear. He steps back; tells her that what she can do now is believe in Ichinose&#x27;s class&#x27;s victory; she counters &quot;Then you don&#x27;t know what measures I might take, do you?&quot;; he calls it interesting and leaves for the restroom.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Going to the restroom? Can I have a moment?”<span class=\"pg\">p.84<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It’s surprising to see you coming out as a representative today.”<span class=\"pg\">p.84<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Give me the win. I want you to discreetly hold back.”<span class=\"pg\">p.84<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “What if I say I’ll properly give you something in return?”<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sae-chan is the one I definitely can’t lose to. For that, I’m willing to do anything.”<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You know what I mean, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then you don’t know what measures I might take, do you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Per the printed TL NOTE inside this scene, &quot;吐いた唾は飲めぬ&quot; (spat-out saliva cannot be swallowed) glosses as &quot;words once spoken cannot be taken back.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> &quot;Sae-chan is the one I definitely can&#x27;t lose to&quot; — her nemesis from the prologue monologue; her willingness to do anything is aimed at Sae&#x27;s class&#x27;s victory path.<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She recognizes he is unreadable — &quot;It&#x27;s like... you can see right through my mind.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.84–86<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12-p65-1\">← Before: Ch.3: The body checks (Class B and D rooms)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p8-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"","w":"hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie prologue  behind the scenes hoshinomiya watches the end of year special exam unfold on the monitors with bated breath  with kijima observing as a spectator  her means of intervention are gone  prime minister kijima visits  hoshinomiya has no choice but to be content with the situation  the four homeroom teachers are left behind when kijima and the chairman leave  hoshinomiya burns with resentment at chabashira s promotion to class a   congratulations  sae chan  even if it s temporary  you re in class a now    unattributed  the reply  i d like to thank you  but the exam just ended  is chabashira s  hoshinomiya s resentment grows   i will never let this woman win  i won t let her graduate from class a","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p8-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Prologue: Behind the Scenes<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.8–10<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Hoshinomiya watches the end-of-year special exam unfold on the monitors with bated breath; with Kijima observing as a spectator, her means of intervention are gone. Prime Minister Kijima visits; Hoshinomiya has no choice but to be content with the situation. The four homeroom teachers are left behind when Kijima and the Chairman leave; Hoshinomiya burns with resentment at Chabashira&#x27;s promotion to Class A.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Congratulations, Sae-chan. Even if it’s temporary, you’re in Class A now.” — unattributed; the reply (“I’d like to thank you, but the exam just ended...”) is Chabashira&#x27;s. Hoshinomiya&#x27;s resentment grows: “I will never let this woman win. I won’t let her graduate from Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p28-1\">→ After: Ch.1: Hoshinomiya snaps at her class<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p28-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami shibata-sou hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 1  hoshinomiya snaps at her class unable to bear the class licking its wounds  hoshinomiya slams her palms onto the desk  freezing the room   everyone  do you really understand the situation   i ll say it frankly you re all abnormal  very abnormal   shibata kun  you just said we still have plenty of time ahead  right   do you seriously think so   two goals  three goals  momentum  don t be stupid  the loss really hurt this time   if we have a year  no  that s not it  you understand  don t you  that we only have one year left   there isn t  let me use your beloved soccer as an example  far from scoring two goals back  no matter how you think of it  we ve probably given up three more goals today  and now we re losing by something like ten goals  that s how far behind we are  and to top it off  our opponents are better than us  it s about time you understood that   shut up  what all of you need to do is to accept reality  not babble on about these pipe dreams   we re finished  isn t that right  ichinose san   that s not it   i wasn t looking for weak words like those  i just want you to look at reality   you understand that we re losing now  and that at this rate  we won t be able to win in the future  right   it s alright  ichinose san  i believe in your abilities  just leave all your worries to me  your teacher   so for now  take your time and take care of your heart first  okay  she presses ichinose to face reality  ichinose agrees to stay on as leader  she shuts down his soccer pep talk  she resolves to take action herself  from outside the rules  to save the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p28-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Hoshinomiya snaps at her class<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.28–30<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Unable to bear the class licking its wounds, Hoshinomiya slams her palms onto the desk, freezing the room.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Everyone… do you really understand the situation?”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’ll say it frankly—you’re all abnormal, very abnormal.”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Shibata-kun, you just said we still have plenty of time ahead, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>14 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Do you seriously think so?”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Two goals, three goals? Momentum? Don’t be stupid. The loss really hurt this time.”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If we have a year? No, that’s not it. You understand, don’t you? That we only have one year left.”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There isn’t. Let me use your beloved soccer as an example. Far from scoring two goals back, no matter how you think of it, we’ve probably given up three more goals today, and now we’re losing by something like ten goals. That’s how far behind we are. And to top it off, our opponents are better than us. It’s about time you understood that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Shut up. What all of you need to do is to accept reality, not babble on about these pipe dreams.”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “We’re finished. Isn’t that right, Ichinose-san?”<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s not it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I wasn’t looking for weak words like those. I just want you to look at reality.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You understand that we’re losing now, and that at this rate, we won’t be able to win in the future, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s alright, Ichinose-san. I believe in your abilities. Just leave all your worries to me, your teacher.”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So for now, take your time and take care of your heart first. Okay?”<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She presses Ichinose to face reality; Ichinose agrees to stay on as leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> She shuts down his soccer pep talk.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She resolves to take action herself, from outside the rules, to save the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p8-1\">← Before: Prologue: Behind the Scenes<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p58-1\">→ After: Ch.4: Hoshinomiya-sensei at the café<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p58-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 4  hoshinomiya sensei at the cafe hoshinomiya sensei is seated at the keyaki mall cafe at 12 17  playing with her phone  she needles ayanokoji for being 17 minutes late   you re really late  ayanokoji kun  it s too impudent of you to be 17 minutes late when you re meeting with me   eh  that s it  you could at least tell me why you were late   if this were a date  it would 100  fail here a complete failure   well  scolding you won t bring back the time  it just wastes it  so  you said you wanted to meet me  what s your intention   stop it  i don t feel like i can get along with someone who oversleeps on the first date   huh  at this point   so anything is fine as long as it leads to victory  even using the feelings of girls you like would be fine with you   that s the worst   quite a rude thing to say   anyway  you mentally cornered ichinose san in the exam  and as a result  our class is a mess both inside and out  do you understand the situation here  in the first place  i don t feel like having this sort of talk at length here  okay   i was thinking something like  talking about a student s worries   that is   ha  it s too late now  the special exam is already over and the results are significantly different  and now you want to cooperate  no  no  it s too late  are you stupid   no  even so  it s too suspicious  what i proposed to you was for you to lose to me  ayanokoji kun  in other words  it meant betraying your class   now  you say it s okay to let me win in future special exams  that s too nonsensical   huh  are you serious  you want to sleep with me so you ll betray your class   what other conditions   are you serious   i know you re not very concerned about class a  but sorry  i can t believe it  this kind of consultation is too suspicious  after all  what can you even do  ayanokoji kun  the final showdown is already over   even so  what you alone can do is limited  even if your class falls  sakagami sensei s class will become the next obstacle  and there s no hope for my class to rise  it s like pouring water on a hot stone   i gave you the chance before the end of year special exam  that time was the first and last  understand   that s none of your business  we ll manage somehow on our own   there are ways to rise to class a without doing that  i won t tell you though   i will absolutely make it to class a  by any means necessary   i have no intention of spending any more of my precious time off with a boring child   behind   what s going on  why are sae chan and the others here  he rejects her exemption  the meeting ends with three teachers approaching","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p58-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: Hoshinomiya-sensei at the café<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.58–62<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Hoshinomiya-sensei is seated at the Keyaki Mall café at 12:17, playing with her phone; she needles Ayanokōji for being 17 minutes late.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“You’re really late, Ayanokōji-kun. It’s too impudent of you to be 17 minutes late when you’re meeting with me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Eh, that’s it? You could at least tell me why you were late.”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“...If this were a date, it would 100% fail here—a complete failure.”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>25 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, scolding you won’t bring back the time; it just wastes it. So? You said you wanted to meet me. What’s your intention?”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Stop it. I don’t feel like I can get along with someone who oversleeps on the first date.”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Huh? At this point?”<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So anything is fine as long as it leads to victory? Even using the feelings of girls you like would be fine with you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s the worst.”<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “...Quite a rude thing to say.”<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Anyway. You mentally cornered Ichinose-san in the exam, and as a result, our class is a mess both inside and out. Do you understand the situation here? In the first place, I don’t feel like having this sort of talk at length here, okay?”<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I was thinking something like… talking about a student’s worries?”<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “...That is...”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ha? It’s too late now. The special exam is already over and the results are significantly different. And now you want to cooperate? No, no, it’s too late. Are you stupid?”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No. Even so, it’s too suspicious. What I proposed to you was for you to lose to me, Ayanokōji-kun. In other words, it meant betraying your class.”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “now, you say it’s okay to let me win in future special exams? That’s too nonsensical.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “...Huh? Are you serious? You want to sleep with me so you’ll betray your class?”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “...What other conditions?”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “...Are you serious?”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I know you’re not very concerned about Class A, but sorry, I can’t believe it. This kind of consultation is too suspicious. After all, what can you even do, Ayanokōji-kun? The final showdown is already over.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even so, what you alone can do is limited. Even if your class falls, Sakagami-sensei’s class will become the next obstacle. And there’s no hope for my class to rise. It’s like pouring water on a hot stone.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I gave you the chance before the end-of-year special exam. That time was the first and last. Understand?”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s none of your business. We’ll manage somehow on our own.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There are ways to rise to Class A without doing that. I won’t tell you though.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I will absolutely make it to Class A. By any means necessary.”<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I have no intention of spending any more of my precious time off with a boring child.”<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Behind?”<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “What’s going on…? Why are Sae-chan and the others here?”<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He rejects her exemption; the meeting ends with three teachers approaching.<span class=\"pg\">p.58–62<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p28-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Hoshinomiya snaps at her class<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p70-1\">→ After: Ch.4: The confrontation; her grudge surfaces<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p70-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae mashima-tomonari sakagami ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 4  the confrontation  her grudge surfaces confronted by chabashira  mashima and sakagami in mashima s room  hoshinomiya sensei denies everything  then reveals her grudge against chabashira   so  what s this about  why has it come to this   i wouldn t be asking if i knew  would i   huh  what are you talking about  i don t understand what you mean at all    does that mean you were connected to a phone call at the cafe or something   hmm  but i don t remember having any bad conversations  if you have evidence  let me hear it   that s not evidence  aren t the three of you just trying to set me up   even if i asked ayanokoji kun for help  is that a problem  isn t it a bit too far to call it misconduct just because of that   then report it  if i m to be punished  i ll gladly accept it   oh come on  sae chan  i wouldn t do anything improper  you know  i don t know what you overheard in my conversation with ayanokoji kun  but that s a misunderstanding  it was just a little threat   right  you re making too much of it  well  ayanokoji kun is just a kid  right  maybe he took my joke seriously  even during the exam  i never seriously intended to have him turn traitor  i just wanted to shock him a bit  as a teacher to a class that seemed likely to lose  i just wanted to help them win   isn t it obvious  sae chan  teachers don t take part in battles between students   what s this  i feel like throwing up  so please stop   are you seriously worried  you don t need to worry  if you re going to worry  i wish you wouldn t aim for that unsuitable class a spot   there s no way i can watch your class graduate from class a  sae chan   of course it s wrong   sae chan might selfishly settle her past  that s what i can t stand   that s right  you can t defend yourself  you understand  right  i m the worst kind of woman  but it s okay  i m used to being called that  i ve lived like this since the beginning  and i m thoroughly hated by those who dislike me  you know that well  don t you  sae chan  we ve been together since the first year of high school   if you want me to stop  give up your dream of reaching class a   you can  after all  you were like that in the past  you were a cold homeroom teacher and disliked by your students  even if that s all you do now  it might help me   don t hesitate  promise me you ll be cold like before  right now  if you can t do that  then never interfere again   that s fine  of course  i won t commit any violations  but i will struggle to the end in my own way  and if any misconduct ends up being discovered  i will accept being fired   i will never accept you   even if you hold off  i won t change my mind   well  if that s all  her grudge traces to the unanimous vote special exam when they were students  her class s dreams were cut short by chabashira sensei s refusal to sacrifice her classmates  p 73  she wants chabashira to regret it forever  and losing this way of coping would leave her with nothing  she demands chabashira give up class a  chabashira breaks down  mashima suggests waiting over spring break  sakagami warns she could be fired  she wants ichinose s class to rise  her removal would adversely affect the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p70-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: The confrontation; her grudge surfaces<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.70–76<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Confronted by Chabashira, Mashima and Sakagami in Mashima&#x27;s room, Hoshinomiya-sensei denies everything, then reveals her grudge against Chabashira.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"sakagami.html\">Sakagami<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“So? What’s this about? Why has it come to this?”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I wouldn’t be asking if I knew, would I?”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Huh? What are you talking about? I don’t understand what you mean at all —”<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>26 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Does that mean you were connected to a phone call at the cafe or something??”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Hmm. But I don’t remember having any bad conversations. If you have evidence, let me hear it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s not evidence. Aren’t the three of you just trying to set me up??”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even if I asked Ayanokōji-kun for help, is that a problem? Isn’t it a bit too far to call it misconduct just because of that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then report it. If I’m to be punished, I’ll gladly accept it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh come on, Sae-chan. I wouldn’t do anything improper, you know. I don’t know what you overheard in my conversation with Ayanokōji-kun, but that’s a misunderstanding. It was just a little threat.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Right? You’re making too much of it. Well, Ayanokōji-kun is just a kid, right? Maybe he took my joke seriously. Even during the exam, I never seriously intended to have him turn traitor; I just wanted to shock him a bit. As a teacher to a class that seemed likely to lose, I just wanted to help them win.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Isn’t it obvious, Sae-chan? Teachers don’t take part in battles between students.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “...What’s this? I feel like throwing up, so please stop.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Are you seriously worried? You don’t need to worry. If you’re going to worry, I wish you wouldn’t aim for that unsuitable Class A spot.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There’s no way I can watch your class graduate from Class A, Sae-chan.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Of course it’s wrong.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sae-chan might selfishly settle her past. That’s what I can’t stand.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s right, you can’t defend yourself. You understand, right? I’m the worst kind of woman. But it’s okay, I’m used to being called that. I’ve lived like this since the beginning, and I’m thoroughly hated by those who dislike me. You know that well, don’t you, Sae-chan? We’ve been together since the first year of high school.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If you want me to stop, give up your dream of reaching Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You can. After all, you were like that in the past. You were a cold homeroom teacher and disliked by your students. Even if that’s all you do now, it might help me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Don’t hesitate. Promise me you’ll be cold like before, right now. If you can’t do that, then never interfere again.”<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s fine. Of course, I won’t commit any violations. But I will struggle to the end in my own way, and if any misconduct ends up being discovered, I will accept being fired.”<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I will never accept you.”<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even if you hold off, I won’t change my mind.”<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, if that’s all...”<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her grudge traces to the unanimous-vote special exam when they were students: her class’s dreams were cut short by Chabashira-sensei’s refusal to sacrifice her classmates (p.73). She wants Chabashira to regret it forever, and losing this way of coping would leave her with nothing.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> She demands Chabashira give up Class A; Chabashira breaks down.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Mashima suggests waiting over spring break.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakagami<\/b> Sakagami warns she could be fired.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She wants Ichinose’s class to rise; her removal would adversely affect the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p58-1\">← Before: Ch.4: Hoshinomiya-sensei at the café<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p200-1\">→ After: Epilogue: the joker is gone<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p200-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie epilogue  the joker is gone after the opening ceremony she calls sae chan out of the staff room and walks with her toward the third year corridor   of course  i won t change i absolutely won t let sae chan graduate from class a  she retracts the threat to cheat  and promises she is not imposing any conditions   what i said before about resorting to cheating to stop you from finishing as class a i m retracting that statement  ayanokoji persuaded her to accept the situation  she calls him a joker who can sway class competitions and resentful feelings alike  at the classroom door she tells chabashira the joker is no longer in her hand  enters class 3 d and shuts the door  looking forward to sae chan s despair  she drops the cheating threat  then reveals that the transfer out of class 2 d has already been decided","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p200-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: the joker is gone<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.200–202<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the opening ceremony she calls Sae-chan out of the staff room and walks with her toward the third-year corridor. She retracts the threat to cheat, and promises she is not imposing any conditions. At the classroom door she tells Chabashira the joker is no longer in her hand, enters Class 3-D and shuts the door, looking forward to Sae-chan&#x27;s despair.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Of course. I won’t change—I absolutely won’t let Sae-chan graduate from Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“What I said before about resorting to cheating to stop you from finishing as Class A—I’m retracting that statement.”<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Ayanokōji persuaded her to accept the situation; she calls him a joker who can sway class competitions and resentful feelings alike.<span class=\"pg\">p.201<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> She drops the cheating threat, then reveals that the transfer out of Class 2-D has already been decided.<span class=\"pg\">p.200–202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y2v12_5-p70-1\">← Before: Ch.4: The confrontation; her grudge surfaces<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y3v2-p182-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie ch 6   depth read  hoshinomiya s boundary test meets ayanokoji in the special building  both claim the other was called by ichinose  presses against him   whaaat are you talking about  a teacher would never call a student out to a place like this   i need you to do your best this year  ayanokouji kun  so it s fine if i give you a little bit of service  right   we re in this together  aren t we  so there s no way i d do anything to drag you down  right   you just have to arrange things so my class takes first and your class takes second   i can trust you  right    a veiled threat if betrayed playful and flirtatious on the surface  still desperate to return her class to class a and see chabashira fall  tests ayanokoji and demands results  tests him physically to probe the exam  wants him to make her class win  her class is allied with ayanokoji s  rival  wants her class to fall","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y3v2-p182-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 — depth read: Hoshinomiya&#x27;s boundary test<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.182–210<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meets Ayanokōji in the special building (both claim the other was called by Ichinose); presses against him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Whaaat are you talking about~? A teacher would never call a student out to a place like this.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I need you to do your best this year, Ayanokouji-kun, so it&#x27;s fine if I give you a little bit of service, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.186<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;We&#x27;re in this together, aren&#x27;t we? So there&#x27;s no way I&#x27;d do anything to drag you down, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You just have to arrange things so my class takes first and your class takes second.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I can trust you, right?&quot; — a veiled threat if betrayed<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful and flirtatious on the surface, still desperate to return her class to Class A and see Chabashira fall; tests Ayanokōji and demands results.<span class=\"pg\">p.185–189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Tests him physically to probe the exam; wants him to make her class win.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her class is allied with Ayanokōji&#x27;s.<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Rival; wants her class to fall.<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y3v2-p184-1\">→ After: Hoshinomiya&#x27;s advance and the alliance check<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y3v2-p184-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie","q":"hoshinomiya chie hoshinomiya s advance and the alliance check arrives at the special building in high spirits  claiming ichinose told her ayanokoji wanted to see her  presses against him and entwines her arm with his   sorry for the wait  ayanokouji kun  did you need something from me  calling me out to a place like this   whaaat are you talking about  a teacher would never call a student out to a place like this   i need you to do your best this year  ayanokouji kun  so it s fine if i give you a little bit of service  right   we re in this together  aren t we  so there s no way i d do anything to drag you down  right   you just have to arrange things so my class takes first and your class takes second   i can trust you  right    with a threat hidden behind it  i see  well  you certainly did come through for me during the last special exam  so i suppose i ll just wait and see for now  playful and flirtatious on the surface  still desperate to return her class to class a and see chabashira fall  her advance is a deliberate test that ayanokoji reads  withdraws when he invokes chabashira  tests him physically  he stops her with words and orders her to trust the alliance long term  her class is allied with ayanokoji s  her rival  whose class she wants to see fall  the mere name makes her withdraw her arm","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y3v2-p184-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hoshinomiya&#x27;s advance and the alliance check<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.184–189<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at the special building in high spirits, claiming Ichinose told her Ayanokōji wanted to see her; presses against him and entwines her arm with his.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Sorry for the wait, Ayanokouji-kun. Did you need something from me, calling me out to a place like this?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Whaaat are you talking about~? A teacher would never call a student out to a place like this.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I need you to do your best this year, Ayanokouji-kun, so it&#x27;s fine if I give you a little bit of service, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.186<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;We&#x27;re in this together, aren&#x27;t we? So there&#x27;s no way I&#x27;d do anything to drag you down, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You just have to arrange things so my class takes first and your class takes second.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I can trust you, right?&quot; — with a threat hidden behind it<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I see. Well, you certainly did come through for me during the last special exam, so I suppose I&#x27;ll just wait and see for now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful and flirtatious on the surface, still desperate to return her class to Class A and see Chabashira fall; her advance is a deliberate test that Ayanokōji reads; withdraws when he invokes Chabashira.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Tests him physically; he stops her with words and orders her to trust the alliance long-term.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her class is allied with Ayanokōji&#x27;s.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Her rival, whose class she wants to see fall; the mere name makes her withdraw her arm.<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-hoshinomiya-chie-y3v2-p182-1\">← Before: Ch.6 — depth read: Hoshinomiya&#x27;s boundary test<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
